cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use APEXA in your research, please cite it using the metadata
  below. A DOI minted through DOECode (OSTI) will be added on release.
title: "APEXA: Advanced Photon EXperiment Assistant"
abstract: >-
  APEXA is a multi-agent AI framework that operates a synchrotron beamline
  as an intelligent instrument. It orchestrates five specialist agents
  (Calibration, Analysis, Knowledge, Visualization, Motor Control) over
  57 domain tools spanning detector calibration, 2D-to-1D azimuthal
  integration, high-energy diffraction microscopy (HEDM), crystallographic
  phase identification, and real-time EPICS motor control. Motor-safety
  guarantees are enforced at the tool-execution layer rather than at the
  prompt layer. APEXA is deployed at the Advanced Photon Source, Argonne
  National Laboratory.
type: software
